2) Orthopedics referral — I’m wondering whether I should be referred to Northwest Orthopedics for evaluation (please advise if you need more details about symptoms). If referral is appropriate, please coordinate and let me know any testing or imaging you want first (e.g., X‑ray).

My current meds: levothyroxine 75 mcg, lisinopril 20 mg, atorvastatin 40 mg. Also, my last peak flow was 320. Please let me know if you want any additional history or if we should schedule a visit or telehealth to discuss.

Thanks,
