- Do you already have a diagnosis of atrial fibrillation (AFib), or are you concerned about it because of symptoms (palpitations, lightheadedness, irregular pulse)?  
- Are you currently taking any anticoagulant (warfarin, apixaban, rivaroxaban, dabigatran) or antiplatelet (aspirin)?  
