- If surgery is recommended, how would anticoagulation be managed peri‑operatively (stop, bridge, timing)?
- Do I need bone health screening (DEXA) or fall‑risk assessment before referring or before any surgery?
- If I want to avoid surgery, what are other options the orthopedist would recommend (injections, PT, regenerative therapies)?
- Can you recommend a specific provider at Northwest Orthopedics who handles my joint/problem? (Ask for a direct referral and how urgent it is.)

