  - Summarizes these AF questions and requests his assessment about anticoagulation and possible cardiology referral, and
  - Asks whether you need a referral to Northwest Orthopedics (and requests imaging or pre-referral steps if needed)?

If yes, tell me whether you want the message sent now as a draft or sent immediately, and whether to include any personal details or urgency (e.g., “please schedule soon” or “routine annual physical”).


