Meanwhile, here are focused points, tests, and specific questions to bring to Dr. David Nguyen (PCP) and to guide whether cardiology/orthopedics referrals are needed.

Atrial fibrillation — what to discuss and ask your PCP
- If you have AF (or symptoms suggesting AF), key topics:
