- If you want to see a cardiologist, suggested referral request language: “Referral for cardiology evaluation for AF management and anticoagulation/ stroke-prevention given prior stroke and hypertension; please include ECG, ambulatory monitoring, TTE, and labs (TSH, BMP, CBC).”
- If you want orthopedics referral, suggested PCP request: “Referral to orthopedics for evaluation of [describe joint/problem]. Please advise on imaging and comment on perioperative anticoagulation planning if surgery is likely.”

